<title>JAPAN: MOF says Japan banks can cope with problem loans.</title>
<headline>MOF says Japan banks can cope with problem loans.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese financial institutions can sufficiently cope with problem loans, Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He told the finance committee of the Lower House of parliament that financial institutions have steadily disposed of problem loans.</p>
</text>
